1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:06,520
Slide 34 diagrams THE WORKSPACE COMPLIANCE PATH: The 3 Pillars of Safe AI.

2
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:11,913
How do we turn the dangerous shadow kingdom into an enterprise fortress?

3
00:00:11,913 --> 00:00:14,410
Look at the three pillars on screen.

4
00:00:14,810 --> 00:00:17,076
Pillar 1: Enterprise Tenant Lock.

5
00:00:17,076 --> 00:00:22,295
All employee desktop agents authenticate through corporate Google Cloud IAM.

6
00:00:22,295 --> 00:00:26,760
Every query is bound by zero-data-training enterprise agreements!

7
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:29,118
Pillar 2: Local DLP Redaction.

8
00:00:29,118 --> 00:00:39,500
Before any screen snapshot or clipboard text leaves the laptop, an on-device regex and NER model masks social security numbers and passwords with `[REDACTED]`!

9
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:42,646
And Pillar 3: Immutable Audit Trail.

10
00:00:42,646 --> 00:00:51,420
Every single action, screen region inspected, and tool call is recorded into a tamper-evident SHA-256 JSONL ledger!

11
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:58,760
If a compliance auditor asks what the AI did six months ago, you hand them the cryptographic ledger in 3 seconds!

12
00:00:59,160 --> 00:01:06,500
Compliance is not an obstacle to innovation; it is the structural integrity that allows innovation to scale safely.

